00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The trainer projects an orbital image of a dark opening on Arsia Mons. Beside it, they place a photograph of the lava-tube training site. On Mars, we are looking for cavities that could serve as shelter. Here you will descend with rope and harness, scan the ceiling in three dimensions, and restore communication from inside the tube.
